        "Description": "You are an assassin hired to take down two targets and one leading guard.\r\rThey are notorious for sadistic pleasures and distaining attributes following the deaths of 2 Furries who are managers of the Furry society. Your client, an assistant and loyal to the Furry, kindly ask to eliminate these targets without being spotted or leaving traces behind. You will also eliminate their lead bodyguard, if he ever suspect the missing fellow mercenaries. Don&apos;t let the Anti-Furry know you did this.",
